# rpmlint filters. Each one states why the finding cannot be satisfied.

# The words are a file name extension (the tcc-guard configuration file
# /etc/asus-ux8406-tcc-guard.toml) and parts of package names
# (asus-zenbook-duo-ux8406-keyboard-bpf, iio-sensor-proxy); none can be spelled
# differently, and the descriptions need them to tell the reader what to
# configure or install.
# KWin, Wayland, Plasma, emoji and touchscreen are names that the descriptions
# need. They are in the same filter: the dictionary of Fedora 45 has some of
# them, and rpmlint fails on a filter that matches nothing.
addFilter(r"spelling-error .*'(toml|bpf|iio|kwin|wayland|plasma|emoji|touchscreen)'")
